        "value": "<p>A sword duel played on your keyboard. Finish words to strike, read the skeleton's cue, and turn a well-timed parry into an opening.</p>\n<p><strong>Free in your desktop browser. Keyboard required.</strong> Click <strong>Run game</strong> above to play.</p>\n<h2>Type to attack</h2>\n<p>Complete the highlighted word to swing your sword.</p>\n<h2>Space to parry</h2>\n<p>Watch for the yellow attack cue and time Space to parry the incoming swing.</p>\n<h2>Unleash Slayer</h2>\n<p>Break enemy stamina to unleash Slayer: each correct keystroke becomes a rapid strike.</p>\n<h2>Learn the rhythm</h2>\n<p>The interactive tutorial walks through attacking, accuracy, parrying and Slayer. Skip it or replay it from the menu.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Key</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Letters</td><td>Type to attack</td></tr><tr><td>Space</td><td>Parry</td></tr><tr><td>Esc</td><td>Pause</td></tr><tr><td>R / M</td><td>Restart / menu from pause or results</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Follow development</h2>\n<p>Use itch.io's <strong>Follow</strong> button to follow development. Tried a duel? Leave a comment below with the moment that clicked&mdash;or where you got stuck.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://lyniadesign.itch.io/tiny-pixel-japan-parallax-background\">Tiny Pixel Japan Parallax Background</a> by <strong>LyniaDesign</strong>, used under the author's license. Palette adapted for CLACKBLADE.</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://pimen.itch.io/battle-vfx-hit-spark\">Hit Spark</a> and <a href=\"https://pimen.itch.io/pixel-battle-effects\">Battle Effects</a> by <strong>Pimen</strong>. Hit Spark uses the included author license; Battle Effects is <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\">CC BY 4.0</a>. Animation timing, pivots and scale adapted; Battle Effects converted to white for Slayer.</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://kenney.nl/assets/input-prompts-pixel\">Input Prompts Pixel</a> by <strong>Kenney</strong> (CC0).</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://kenney.nl/assets/impact-sounds\">Impact Sounds</a> and <a href=\"https://kenney.nl/assets/ui-audio\">UI Audio</a> by <strong>Kenney</strong> (CC0).</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/vt323\">VT323</a> by <strong>Peter Hull</strong> (SIL Open Font License 1.1).</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://opengameart.org/content/free-vfx-asset-pack\">Free VFX Asset Pack</a> by <strong>CodeManu</strong> (CC0); retained legacy sheets adapted by CLACKBLADE. Current impact particles are implemented in the project.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Credits and licenses are included in the browser build. Attribution for the retained hero and skeleton assets and original music is still being verified.</p>"
      },
